# Used instead of the root .dockerignore for this Dockerfile (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore beside it). The root one excludes .github/ and
# docs/, which is right for the production image and wrong here: the
# devcontainer reads its versions from those files. Allow-list exactly them.
*
!.github/workflows/ci.yml
!.github/workflows/qa-accessibility.yml
!.devcontainer/install-toolchain.sh
!docs/qa/browser/package.json
!docs/qa/browser/package-lock.json
